# `sqlx::migrate!` checksums the *bytes* of every file in `migrations/` and
# stores that checksum in `_sqlx_migrations`. This repo is developed with
# `core.autocrlf=true`, so without this rule a fresh checkout would hand the
# migrator CRLF files whose checksums differ from the LF ones already recorded
# in the owner's `family.db` — every boot would then fail with a migration
# version mismatch. Pin them to LF everywhere. (T1.1, sole owner of
# `migrations/`.)
migrations/*.sql text eol=lf
